# GUIBAUX

GUIBAUX, executed in wayland or x as "guibaux" will be:

* Forked, Rewritten in pure c, Merged hacks of:
  * cool-retro-terminal
  * neovide
  * baux
* all configurations done in vi update only  after recompile... 
  * it's all got to be done this way... because
    * THIS IS VAPORWARE
    * THIS IS NOT FOR YOU
    * THIS is my "learn c you dumb bash hack" project.
